---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-border bg-surface/35">
  <div class="shell py-10 sm:py-12">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between">
      <div class="max-w-md">
        <div class="flex items-center">
          <span class="font-display text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight">
            DeepSeek Harness<span class="text-accent">插件市场</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
          DeepSeek Harness插件市场（DSH插件市场）是面向 DeepSeek Harness
          用户的插件目录。插件由各自的作者独立维护。
        </p>
      </div>

      <nav class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-10 gap-y-3 text-sm" aria-label="页脚">
        <a href="/plugins" class="text-muted-foreground transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-foreground">
          全部插件
        </a>
        <a href="/help" class="text-muted-foreground transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-foreground">
          帮助
        </a>
        <a href="/tags" class="text-muted-foreground transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-foreground">
          标签
        </a>
        <a href="/about" class="text-muted-foreground transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-foreground">
          关于
        </a>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/phil616/dsh-plugin-market"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-muted-foreground transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-foreground"
        >
          项目源码
        </a>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-border pt-6 text-xs text-muted-foreground sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
      <p>© {year} DeepSeek Harness插件市场贡献者</p>
      <p class="font-mono">纯静态站点 · 无后端 · 无追踪</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
